{:edb/db-before-t 1813 :edb/db-after-t 1814 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535126 50 #inst "2026-10-08T17:29:20.882Z" 13194139535126 true] [17592186059774 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332572 13194139535126 true] [17592186060042 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535126 true] [17592186060042 1100 "$\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+{120}^{∘})=$" 13194139535126 true] [17592186060042 1100 "What is $\\sin (x + 120^{∘})$?" 13194139535126 false] [17592186060042 1145 "Recall the sum formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u+v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v+\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the sum formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v={120}^{∘},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+{120}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡{120}^{∘}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡{120}^{∘} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})+\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535126 true] [17592186068613 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332558 13194139535126 true] [17592186087659 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332565 13194139535126 true] [17592186100876 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332579 13194139535126 true] [17592186171845 1020 #edb/ref 17592186332586 13194139535126 true] [17592186332558 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332559 13194139535126 true] [17592186332558 1089 "q-114251" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332558 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535126 true] [17592186332558 1100 "${lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{{x}^{2}+2x+1}{({x}^{2}-4)^{2}-12x-21}=$" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332558 1113 #uuid "26d3b422-7b5a-59f6-92d8-0b2ae0c592e0" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332558 1145 "If we plug in $x=-1$ we get the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0},$ so  we apply L'Hopital's rule to find the limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{{x}^{2}+2x+1}{({x}^{2}-4)^{2}-12x-21} & ={lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{{[{x}^{2}+2x+1]}^{′}}{{[({x}^{2}-4)^{2}-12x-21]}^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{2x+2}{4x({x}^{2}-4)-12} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{x+1}{2x({x}^{2}-4)-6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis time, the resulting limit still gives the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0}.$ To find the limit, we apply L'Hopital's rule once again. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{{x}^{2}+2x+1}{({x}^{2}-4)^{2}-12x-21} & ={lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{x+1}{2x({x}^{2}-4)-6} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{{[x+1]}^{′}}{{[2x({x}^{2}-4)-6]}^{′}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to -1}\\frac{1}{6{x}^{2}-8} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6(-1)^{2}-8} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332560 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332561 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332562 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332563 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332564 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1041 "selection" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332560 13194139535126 true] [17592186332559 1110 #uuid "bac6883d-4ab0-5dbd-ab9a-f112e4fbc14f" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332560 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332560 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535126 true] [17592186332560 1111 #uuid "478d2baa-dfdb-5f7c-a968-32c9a381c1fe" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332561 1034 "2" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332561 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535126 true] [17592186332561 1111 #uuid "3333da21-a267-50fd-983d-00e50c8d5023" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332562 1034 "1" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332562 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535126 true] [17592186332562 1111 #uuid "644de2b3-6ce8-5b18-a2e4-a066efcf714d" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332563 1034 "-4" 13194139535126 true] [17592186332563 1103 #edb/ref 175921